    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SAN FRANCISCO\nDONG KINGMAN",
      "SAN FRANCISCO\nDong Kingman, the award winning Chinese-American artist, travels the world sketching and painting\nthe beautiful, the monumental and the picturesque. His watercolors grace more than forty\npermanent museum and private collections in the USA and abroad\nSAN FRANCISCO the city on the bay, is a favorite of everyone. From Grant Avenue, in the heart of\nChinatown, with its Festivals, to Nob Hill, Fisherman's Wharf or the Golden Gate Bridge, there is so\nmuch to see. The quaint Cable Cars and other historical attractions blend with fine restaurants.\nelegant stores, and famous hotels such as Inter-Continental's renowned Mark Hopkins, to create a\nunique atmosphere. Pan Am serves San Francisco every day from New York, Houston, Miami,\nCentral and South America, Hawaii, Tokyo, Hong Kong, and London. In fact, you can get to\nSan Francisco on Pan Am from just about any place in the world.\nNAM.\n2001.080.247∞",
      "Cocktailio\nSherry Dubonnet Campari\nManhattan Gin Martini Vodka Martini Vermouth\nBloody Mary Screwdriver Whiskey Sour\nTom Collins Vodka Collins Daiquiri Scotch Bourbon\nCanadian Gin Vodka Rum Premium Beer\nMenus\nApéritif\n*:\nSelected Gourmet Delicacies\nRoast au Vol\nA selected cut of aged beef, turkey or other succulent meat\nroasted on board and carved to order\nYour flight attendant will advise you of today's roast\nSeafood Platter\nCold lush seafood with a tangy Japanese sauce\nBreast of Chicken Oriental\nTrout Grenobloise\nTrout sauteed with capers, lemon, butter and fresh parsley\nPlat du Jour",
      "Breast of Chicken Orienta\nTrout Grenobloise\nTrout sauteed with capers, lemon, butter and fresh parsley\nPlat du Jour\nsteamed Rice\nPotatoes Maison\nButtered Vegetable Bouquet\nTossed Garden Salaa\nCoffee\n0 - E-\nTea\nSelection of Fruits and Cheeses\nDessert\n- H\nGreen Tea\nDecaffeinated Coffee\nSelected French Wines\nFrench Champagne Brut\nDrambuie Amaretto di Saronno Bénédictine\nCrème de Menthe Cognac VSOP\nContreau\n428 KJ2-12(F)-",
      "Flight\nFancy\nPORK NORMANDY\nFilet of pork with white mushroom\ncream sauce."
    ],
